    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3ff7dfa5ef752e83538be29",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在观众们的殷切期盼下，这场激战即将展开。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ca13903d4fe468ae166530ff1f25461bd8e38511fff541bc30233c8cae99f1d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
