      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c84f671270cb95fb22626620",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向宝冢纪念",
      "source_fingerprint": "4743315d92bef0a1d3815aad5f8b1374f193f12e0416639bccc69a7a0dc88f06",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57a89cb83a621a9ac8e924fb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "到了“札幌纪念”当天，\n这场比赛将是气槽东山再起的一战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fa78aaee23aee663e83ab8a9db0919360e6b99bcc563c2b64a98e13900ff639",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f2d1d8dada938235b14fac4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了拿出不负粉丝期待的表现，\n“女帝”气槽迈开步伐，上场比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab9e98326e0997de41a9d385394794b565533643074db25fc6e67cae065bdda8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1b6397711fcbe005883bb40",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向札幌纪念",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdb4f067412287a97a06ec9fa61e73c9f02df5d5c272e5294d3a5deee61f50fa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:075c0234850af23782c53ffa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在“天皇赏（秋）”，\n气槽与无声铃鹿即将再次对决，\n会场笼罩在一股非比寻常的热烈气氛下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2759ec089788017e3d607a8a28c230caf83498611ed50563b5d2aeadb6563fe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e45c5de654c9640efcc4a15c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽已重新下定决心，\n无声铃鹿则一直盼望能与这样的她对决，\n两人的交谈十分沉稳。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7513a82f98440382c63d28039941fb3961966b8a121b3ca2285eccf311456466",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:070ec1d1ec0de2f8ca3ca471",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是，身为引导所有赛马娘的“挑战者”，\n同时也是训练员的“理想”……\n“女帝”上场挑战“天皇赏（秋）”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41b37c8534b367d4eb70f52e4ea71fb854d98a6f4b93ffe235fd48e8bb0481c0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:693780c30d80c5c25e47cc41",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向天皇赏（秋）",
      "source_fingerprint": "acd583fd839f6680a57f75e09880ff12f48e50ac7beeab6d01036df8eff7ff5e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7440b4f1fe9048930a6e535d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽漂亮地跑完了“出道战”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b784920261a19972d02a1297cb1acf51619074bbab95fcabdc67a15ce544f1e5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f0acfa17c66551fdb11cae5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她表明了自己的决心──\n要保持干劲，以“女帝”之姿向前迈进，\n好让自己更受瞩目。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b80d2924b9742964dcefcb378e2c63c651cacb0c8c6c7fcc80e1e56f4e3298b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2569e8ba6da4226345c342e7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道战结束后・就此揭幕",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bc1a931f7f5b66c5ae70a5370a494464f5d123df0ee1879c7635d3a922d489d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:332d399904ee8886154994e2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽以极为出色的表现拿下了“阪神JF”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa4ccd2ed4f7a528cb1564830d1fbf5aa89318824c897569f4af5810ae3180aa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c708225cd6573f8235f5028a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但这不过是她往自己理想前进的中途站。",
      "source_fingerprint": "121742304cfd233501b4f3ef9dd8187e7725a8430bafc85529927d55854648a4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a568a5b8626095a7db51ebda",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽为了让众多赛马娘\n希望“变得像自己这样”──",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8c3f91b8d859384204178985074567163dfb7cc60138d7bf84a1ee533f9d2ff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a17d9c9ec114111f90dbc71",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她坚定且毫不犹疑地表示自己\n要以后冠路线为目标，一路冲刺三场比赛──\n“樱花赏”、“橡树大赛”、“秋华赏”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d193d2a88a9e05a3ab242d0da56bd98ad909090652484dd0b96e2d5aad7a15b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2520812ac45b926322f529cd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "阪神JF结束后・辉煌的一步",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e0345ef159dac0a69ed8817fc7ceff9029c785825191e70f0cb4f8b46b87a1c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a0de12f790bb7a44659ef1c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽在“阪神JF”与胜利擦身而过。\n她誓言要将这次的失败经验活用于未来，\n并对下一场比赛斗志高涨。",
      "source_fingerprint": "67eb5593635a67ce329e26b935e72bcbd35b0f33d3218854148feda87695aa0c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:754451e815ce3697fd8889b2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛过后数天，她成了众人的瞩目焦点，\n大家几乎每天都在讨论\n她接下来会参加哪些比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0f69b991ce26e15deb1520c0f969584cba62f8cb63f370b0c7f32a623a817c6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8843f7bde4c83922fb4f6ee1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在如此备受关注的情况下，\n气槽为了让众多赛马娘对自己抱持憧憬，\n让她们希望“变得像自己这样”──",
      "source_fingerprint": "642cf5ff5eaed2cfc90624b210fd96c4cc8cae04f54efa4a02d5045b3431720e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f581228f6bf427006fd7727",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她坚定且毫不犹疑地表示自己\n要以后冠路线为目标，一路冲刺三场比赛──\n“樱花赏”、“橡树大赛”、“秋华赏”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d193d2a88a9e05a3ab242d0da56bd98ad909090652484dd0b96e2d5aad7a15b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0e27098f898dbfef452e04d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "阪神JF结束后・不屈的模样",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a5af4ae9a0b4e54e8519360ab0c66f1fd1b4f0d52806b31c3fd921d62a06e0e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:156a8c658b135ffabb62d470",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽漂亮地跑完了“樱花赏”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db44646ee7a3c585b674dd2dee3c0c132cd3b2267759525f308728a1b5e74621",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c61b5654ee8294a5772a37c6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在面对过强敌后，\n她预想剩下两场比赛也会是困难的挑战，\n因而燃起了斗志。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ce487ea44d72de22c59534a97daea7fd86a82e8c4827a03a2dab5a8360ee1c0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ccbe4b3825f2f249ff8c053",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了在“橡树大赛”上\n跑出比“樱花赏”更好的成绩，\n气槽保持干劲，开始替下一场比赛做准备。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06c757707718b52480e48e4fc805767b7607bd246c0acc50cbffef504b7251c0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c148361eeea681cd92ecfd11",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花赏结束后・雀跃的挑战",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f2d4d0854a73f28e12f9a2e48ab0c57b32657f322e29b48fd4512e07d9fba5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
