      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽拿下“秋华赏”，就此达成三后冠，\n也向目白多伯展现了何谓“理想”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9b3587013ea9e3f5893cc8942b7251e88664b4cd9d21ed5acd9a945bf286ed1",
